{"v":2,"catch":"用蠟筆為溫暖的聖誕節上色吧！\n走進飄雪的小鎮，禮物、聖誕樹和聖誕老人讓冬天充滿故事。","desc":"《蠟筆聖誕節》是廣受喜愛的蠟筆系列的溫馨冬季版本。\n閃亮的聖誕樹、禮物盒、魯道夫和雪人，都可以用你的色彩來表現。\n真實的蠟筆質感讓溫暖的冬日氣氛更加動人。\n無論是一個人靜靜塗色放鬆，或與家人一起分享聖誕的快樂，都很適合。\n將完成的作品收藏，打造屬於你的聖誕畫廊！","publisher":"GaniTani","release":"2025-12-04","genres":["工具"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c77fa908d1c8661c4e46e3d3ec72bb212ba46c36c46c3a77ab9bb489c14c9521.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/07bbace25c9e22d4a31929f1890ee187fd07aa29d7d56411e2643c6ce8f4fa60.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f40ccd9629c9b503c1306a1ee71f3a809484c79ce9bd3d53c846d630c92a86d6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d676f75efa9d6fc59711d2ca3c7c5eda448afbdfb131e8ba0dd3d3818f5aca02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c524ae27236db90fa4d9b1404fa0d541d6e1eb582f120399c6597c3e172c1d32.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ddcba5418d006544d32c2e7b182ec0ffd1e61c25f72e5628ae82acdf3bef6407.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b43025842000"}